# Secrets — these carry live credentials (PlayFab secret keys, MySQL and admin
# passwords) and, in chain-playfab/.env, a blockchain PRIVATE_KEY. Keep them out
# of git. .env.example files are templates with no real values and stay tracked.
.env
**/.env
*.env
!**/.env.example
.secret
**/.secret
*.pem
*.p12
*.keystore
deploy/*.tar
